5,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,We need a plan that actually serves the users. I'll look into post-occupancy review ratings and booking data for specialist and general rooms.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I agree with Mizuki. I want to check timetable records on rooms out of service and booking data for specialist and general rooms.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,Logic suggests we examine the timeline and costs. I'll take the decade of delivery schedules by project rationale and weather days in the site diaries.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I want to know if the money matches the reality! I'll check tender records over three budget cycles and renewal reserve for equipment bought earlier.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I'm interested in the people doing the work. I'll look at staffing posts since the hiring freeze and bench technicians' weekly manual routines.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
