50,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,"The candidates are A: Study Commons, B: Media Center, C: Path Network, and D: Lab Ventilation. I lean toward A for user satisfaction.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,3,1,talk,Victoria,,"I cannot support C due to weather risks and rental costs. A or D seem more contained, but A serves more people.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,C is out. B is a risk for equipment renewal. A is the most logical for schedule and demand.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,3,1,talk,Kenji,,"D is too expensive given the tender trends. A is a conversion, which should be cheaper and more stable.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,"I strongly prefer D to help the technicians, but I see the budget concerns. A is acceptable if it reduces front-of-house pressure.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shunichi, if we choose A, the service desk might help with the staffing gaps you mentioned.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Mizuki, that's a good point. A conversion of an underused hall is less disruptive than a full lab overhaul.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"It aligns with the booking data. High demand for general space, low risk of weather delays.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,2,talk,Kenji,,I'm sold on A. It's the safest financial and scheduling bet.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"I still want D, but I can't argue with the logic of the group. I'll concede to A.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,It seems we have a consensus on A.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,3,talk,Victoria,,I agree.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,3,talk,Kenji,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
